description=Local web hotspot management for rooted Android (KernelSU). Hotspot control, traffic quota, client management, scheduling, SMS forward, mihomo proxy, PushPlus/DingTalk notifications. Primarily tested on Xiaomi 14 / HyperOS 3 / Android 16. v1.7.2-beta.1: fixes cold-boot status loading, bounded dumpsys collection, shared telephony snapshot, frontend request timeout, and service/action lifecycle issues.
